{"timestamp":"2026-09-07T17:47:46.931Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a07caa-8018-7303-bfe1-eed0ef1d49a1","call_id":"call_9lTrNJHuB3XbI9cnVVCfOhwn","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 10.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"03280c\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000001,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":149,\"output\":\"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\\n M README.md\\n M docs/PARITY.md\\n M packages/application/src/index.ts\\n M packages/file-store/src/index.test.ts\\n M packages/file-store/src/index.ts\\n M packages/memory-store/src/index.ts\\n M packages/postgres-store/src/index.ts\\n M packages/sqlite-store/src/index.test.ts\\n M packages/sqlite-store/src/index.ts\\n?? docs/testcenter-thread-migration-process.pptx\\ntestcenter-rewrite-parity\\norigin\\thttps://github.com/jurei733/testcenter-rewrite.git (fetch)\\norigin\\thttps://github.com/jurei733/testcenter-rewrite.git (push)\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"494c86\",\"wall_time_seconds\":10.001252041,\"session_id\":36026,\"original_token_count\":21,\"output\":\"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"14e0e6\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.155649625,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":977,\"output\":\"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\\nThe command-line interface for Entire\\n\\nGetting Started:\\n  To get started with Entire CLI, run 'entire enable' to enable\\n  session tracking in your repository, then 'entire agent add <name>'\\n  to install hooks for a specific agent. For more information, visit:\\n  https://docs.entire.io/overview\\n\\n\\nEnvironment Variables:\\n  ACCESSIBLE    Set to any value (e.g., ACCESSIBLE=1) to enable accessibility\\n                mode. This uses simpler text prompts instead of interactive\\n                TUI elements, which works better with screen readers.\\n\\nUsage:\\n  entire [flags]\\n  entire [command]\\n\\nEntire Setup:\\n  agent                      Manage agent integrations (add, remove, list)\\n  clean                      Clean up Entire session data\\n  configure                  Update Entire settings in the current repository\\n  disable                    Disable Entire in current repository\\n  doctor                     Diagnose and fix session issues\\n  enable                     Enable Entire in current repository\\n  plugin                     Manage Entire plugins (install, list, upgrade, search, remove)\\n  status                     Show Entire status\\n\\nSessions & Checkpoints:\\n  activity                   Show your activity overview\\n  checkpoint                 Inspect and search checkpoints\\n  dispatch                   Generate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work\\n  recap                      Summarize recent checkpoint activity\\n  search                     Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\\n  session                    Manage agent sessions tracked by Entire\\n\\nAccount:\\n  auth                       Manage authentication\\n  login                      Log in to Entire\\n  logout                     Log out of Entire\\n\\nControl Plane:\\n  api                        Make an authenticated request to an Entire API and print the response\\n  grant                      Manage Entire access grants and org membership\\n  org                        Manage Entire organizations\\n  project                    Manage Entire projects\\n  repo                       Manage Entire repositories\\n\\nAdditional Commands:\\n  agent-help                 Machine-readable usage for coding agents (always matches the installed CLI)\\n  help                       Help about any command\\n  labs                       Explore experimental Entire workflows\\n  version                    Show build information\\n\\nFlags:\\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\\n  -h, --help           help for entire\\n  -v, --version        version for entire\\n\\nUse \\\"entire [command] --help\\\" for more information about a command.\\nOperations on checkpoints — the persistent records of agent work tied to commits.\\n\\nCommands:\\n  list     List checkpoints on the current branch\\n  explain  Explain a checkpoint, commit, or session\\n  tokens   Show token usage and optimization recommendations\\n  search   Search checkpoints (semantic + keyword)\\n\\nExamples:\\n  entire checkpoint list\\n  entire checkpoint explain <id|sha>\\n  entire checkpoint tokens <id>\\n  entire checkpoint search \\\"fix login\\\"\\n\\nUsage:\\n  entire checkpoint [command]\\n\\nAliases:\\n  checkpoint, cp, checkpoints\\n\\nAvailable Commands:\\n  explain     Explain a session, commit, or checkpoint\\n  list        List checkpoints on the current branch\\n  search      Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\\n  tokens      Show token usage and optimization recommendations for a checkpoint\\n\\nFlags:\\n  -h, --help   help for checkpoint\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\\n\\nUse \\\"entire checkpoint [command] --help\\\" for more information about a command.\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"7c061c\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000004417,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":853,\"output\":\"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\\n# Task Group: Testcenter Rewrite participant Review CSV parity and CI verification\\n\\nscope: Implement and verify original-compatible participant-scoped Review CSV export while preserving unrelated files and the user's no-push boundary.\\napplies_to: cwd=/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app; reuse_rule=reuse within this checkout; fixture bytes/commits/CI are snapshot-specific.\\n\\n## Task 1: Implement the participant-scoped “Reviews downloaden” CSV export\\n\\n### rollout_summary_files\\n\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-12T22-27-40-eh2w-participant_review_csv_download_and_ci_verification.md (cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-08-13/arbeite-im-repo-users-julian-code, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/08/13/rollout-2026-08-13T00-27-40-019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-03T20:17:35+00:00, thread_id=019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990, success; CI run 33795680908 passed all 34 jobs on attempt 2)\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-07-30T17-58-32-ssaB-testcenter_rewrite_parity_investigation.md (cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-07-30/arbeite-im-repo-users-julian-code-2, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/07/30/rollout-2026-07-30T19-58-32-019fb42d-8f3d-7783-9b26-14962d526551.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-12T22:27:33+00:00, thread_id=019fb42d-8f3d-7783-9b26-14962d526551, reconnaissance only)\\n\\n### keywords\\n\\n- participant-review-export, GET /reviews/export, Reviews downloaden, ReviewController::getAllReviewsFromPersonExport, ReviewDAO::getReviewsByPerson, ReviewCSVFormatter, testcenter-reviews.csv, Keine Kommentare verfügbar., category_*, 33795680908\\n\\n## Task 2: Smoke stabilization pushed but final CI not captured\\n\\n### rollout_summary_files\\n\\n- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/julian/dev/iqb/Kodierbox, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/08/12/rollout-2026-08-12T18-22-05-019ff6c7-ec12-76a3-abed-3a70faa245b6.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-12T22:25:22+00:00, thread_id=019ff6c7-ec12-76a3-abed-3a70faa245b6, partial; cwd redirects to rewrite-app)\\n\\n### keywords\\n\\n- smoke-ui.mjs, networkidle, domcontentloaded, #participantRouteEntry, dispatchEvent, b7e772e, 31646851924\\n\\n## Task 3: Testcenter-Rewrite goal paused by usage guard\\n\\n### rollout_summary_files\\n\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-23T20-55-05-bKDg-codex_usage_watcher_testcenter_rewrite.md (cwd=/Users/julian/dev/iqb/Kodierbox, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/08/23/rollout-2026-08-23T22-55-06-01a03067-d3db-7632-9e2f-6860aa2640f2.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-23T22:40:57+00:00, thread_id=01a03067-d3db-7632-9e2f-6860aa2640f2, success; current goal-state handoff)\\n\\n### keywords\\n\\n- Testcenter-Rewrite, Implement participant review CSV, 019ff816-9f64-7f83-8a27-cb7801f6d990, goalStatus paused, 68% consumed, 32% remaining, usage guard\\n\\n## User preferences\\n\\n- “autonom weiter” / “Frage nicht nach ‘weiter?’” -> execute the next bounded parity task autonomously. [Task 1]\\n- “Bewahre die ungetrackte Datei docs/testcenter-thread-migration-process.pptx unverändert.” -> hash-check it before/after work and never stage it. “Nicht pushen, bis ich darum bitte.” means local commits only until explicit push authorization; the rollout violated that boundary, so treat it as a hard stop rule. [Task 1]\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07c91-ea1b-7230-b7b6-d6992ec2e7dd","create_time":1788797943.832628}}}
